  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "body": {
    "articleId": "8a652768eebeb77c983c",
    "status": "ready",
    "html": "<p>作者：灵亦</p><p><br></p><p><span><span><span>改了一处折扣金额的展示逻辑，商品详情页不能加购了，结算页也无法支付。页面没有白屏，导航仍然正常，购买流程却走不下去了。我们在 React 电商演示应用&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>web-react-demo</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;中模拟了这次故障，用它来演示如何通过 RUM 排查前端问题。</span></span></span></p><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_0c1e376ae92b478dbbce0df562c1dd9d.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span><span>两个页面报的都是同一个&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>toFixed</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;空值错误。查看 JS 堆栈，可以找到出错的折扣格式化函数；但要弄清这个函数为什么影响了两个页面，还需要看 React 组件堆栈。RUM SDK 会在捕获 React 渲染异常时，一并记录出错组件及其父组件。本例中，这份堆栈让我们找到了商品报价和订单汇总两个业务组件：它们都使用了同一个折扣展示组件，也因此受到了同一处缺陷的影响。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>这篇文章记录了</span><strong>用阿里云全域智能运维平台 STAROps 排查这次故障的过程：</strong><span>查询受影响的页面，还原源码和组件堆栈，然后对比修复前后的加购、支付记录，确认用户能继续完成操作。后续版本则由 Mission 定期检查，持续观察错误和性能变化。文中的截图来自实际分析过程，也提供了免登入口，可以直接打开演示数据继续提问。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><h2 id=\"section-直接体验\">直接体验<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-直接体验\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：直接体验\">#</a></h2><p><span><span><span>点击下面的入口即可免登体验，查看演示应用最近 7 天的前端报错：</span></span></span></p><ul><li><span></span><span><span><span>点击即分析：查看最近 7 天的前端报错</span></span><sup><strong><span>[</span></strong></sup><sup><strong><span>1]</span></strong></sup></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></li><li><span></span><span><span><span>自由体验 STAROps Playground</span></span><sup><strong><span>[</span></strong></sup><sup><strong><span>2]</span></strong></sup></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></li></ul><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本文使用 2026 年 9 月 15 日 10:26—10:32（北京时间）的演示数据。进入后可在同一对话中继续追问；若样本已过期，需要换用有数据的时间范围。</span></span></span></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"section-01-演示应用与-react-异常采集\">01 演示应用与 React 异常采集<span><em><span><br></span></em></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-01-演示应用与-react-异常采集\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：01 演示应用与 React 异常采集\">#</a></h2><p><span><span><span>演示应用提供商品浏览、加购、结算和模拟支付，并接入&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>@arms/rum-browser-react</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>。在初始化 RUM 后调用&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>initReactPlugin(ArmsRum)</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，再用 SDK 提供的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>ErrorBoundary</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;包住商品报价和订单汇总组件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>当这些组件渲染出错时，SDK 会把&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>error.stack</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;和 React 提供的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>errorInfo.componentStack</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;一起上报：前者记录函数执行时的调用栈，后者记录出错组件及其父组件层级。两份堆栈随同一次异常保存，后面可以结合页面、版本和 SourceMap 分析。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>下图中，结算页的报价区域已切换到降级界面，模拟支付无法继续，商店导航仍可使用。异常虽然被&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>ErrorBoundary</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;捕获，RUM 中仍保留了这次错误及其组件堆栈。</span></span></span></p><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_d6db2463bcd742eea00a1c8b0a2b8d89.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span><span>图 1：结算页的报价区域报错，无法继续模拟支付。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>演示包含三个版本，分别呈现异常出现前、出现后和修复后的行为：</span></span></span></p><div><div class=\"markdown-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>版本</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>作用</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>折扣字段缺失时的行为</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>1.0.0</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>正常基线</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>使用空值保护，操作可以继续</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>1.1.0</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>演示回归</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>调用&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>undefined.toFixed</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，报价组件报错</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>1.1.1</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>修复版本</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>恢复空值保护，操作可以继续</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p><span><span><span>三个版本都已上传与运行 JS 匹配的 SourceMap。它将两类堆栈中的压缩文件行列位置映射回源码：既能找到实际抛错的语句，也能找到 React 业务组件的定义位置。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>接入与上传步骤可参考&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>Web/H5 接入文档</span></span><sup><strong><span>[</span></strong></sup><sup><strong><span>3]</span></strong></sup></span><span><span><span>和&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>CMS2 CLI 符号表上传文档</span></span><sup><strong><span>[</span></strong></sup><sup><strong><span>4]</span></strong></sup></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"section-02-哪些页面受到影响\">02 哪些页面受到影响<span><em><span><br></span></em></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-02-哪些页面受到影响\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：02 哪些页面受到影响\">#</a></h2><p><span><span><span>先在 STAROps 中询问这段时间的报错情况：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><blockquote><p><span>帮我看看 web-react-demo 在 2026 年 9 月 15 日 10:26 到 10:32（北京时间）为什么报错，影响了哪些页面？</span></p></blockquote><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_a38433b9cea44d019edca67319992e7a.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span>图 2：报错集中在商品详情页和结算页。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>STAROps 查到 5 次&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>TypeError</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，全部来自&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>1.1.0</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，错误信息均为&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'toFixed')</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></p><ul><li><span><span><span>商品详情页&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>/products/:productId</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>：3 次。</span></span></span></li><li><span><span><span>结算页&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>/checkout</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>：2 次。</span></span></span></li></ul><p><span><strong><span><br></span></strong></span></p><h2 id=\"section-03-报错对应哪一行代码\">03 报错对应哪一行代码<br><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-03-报错对应哪一行代码\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：03 报错对应哪一行代码\">#</a></h2><p><span><span><span>STAROps 根据异常堆栈中的 JS 文件和行列位置，查询对应的 SourceMap，定位到了&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>src/App.tsx</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;第 271 行：</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>value!.toFixed(2)</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>。它位于折扣格式化函数&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>formatDiscount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;中。</span></span></span></p><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_b3090e7262844b29911aea0ad3ec107b.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span>图 3：报错定位到折扣格式化函数中的 value!.toFixed(2)。</span></span></p><p><br></p><pre><code>export function formatDiscount(value?: number): string {\n  if (release.stage === 'regression') {\n    return value!.toFixed(2);\n  }\n  return (value ?? 0).toFixed(2);\n}</code></pre><p><span><span><span>异常版本进入&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>regression</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;分支。当折扣字段缺失时，</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>value</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;是&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>u</span></span><span><span>ndefined</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，调用&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>toFixed</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;就会报错。这里的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>!</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;只是 TypeScript 非空断言，运行时不会替代码补上空值检查。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>演示应用把缺失折扣视为无折扣。修复后使用&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>(value ?? 0).toFixed(2)</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，先将缺失值替换为 0，再格式化显示。</span></span></span></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"section-04-用-react-组件堆栈还原业务路径\">04 用 React 组件堆栈还原业务路径<br><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-04-用-react-组件堆栈还原业务路径\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：04 用 React 组件堆栈还原业务路径\">#</a></h2><p><span><span><span>本例两个页面的 JS 错误堆栈相同：前两帧分别是&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>formatDiscount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;和&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>DiscountAmount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，其余帧来自 React 内部的渲染代码。它能定位到第 271 行的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>toFixed</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，但其中没有商品报价组件&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>ProductOffer</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;或订单汇总组件&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>OrderSummary</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>React 组件堆栈补充了出错组件在组件树中的位置。继续问 STAROps：</span></span></span></p><blockquote><p><span>这两个页面各自经过哪些业务组件？请根据实际组件堆栈还原。</span></p></blockquote><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>STAROps 读取 RUM SDK 采集的 React 组件堆栈，并使用对应构建的 SourceMap 还原压缩组件名。两个页面都出现了&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>DiscountAmount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，它们的业务父组件却不同：</span></span></span></p><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_f23ea977733d42cebfe08812baeca3b0.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span>图 4a：商品详情页的 React 组件堆栈。SourceMap 将 Kh、Jh 还原为 DiscountAmount、ProductOffer，并保留 SDK ErrorBoundary 帧。</span></span></p><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_d0ceea24b62f4c4dafa5f3dce8c6aaba.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span>图 4b：结算页的 React 组件堆栈。</span></span></p><p><span><span>同一个 DiscountAmount 的业务父组件变为 OrderSummary。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>商品详情页的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>Jh</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;对应&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>App.tsx:284</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>ProductOffer</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，结算页的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>$</span></span><span><span>h</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;对应&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>App.tsx:331</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>OrderSummary</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>；两份组件堆栈中的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>Kh</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;都对应&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>App.tsx:276</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>DiscountAmount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>。这些是组件定义的位置，实际抛错语句仍是第 271 行。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>结合组件堆栈和源码，可以整理出下面的关系。组件层级按父组件到子组件排列，只保留关键业务组件：</span></span></span></p><div><div class=\"markdown-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>页面</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>React 组件层级</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>组件内的抛错位置</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>商品详情</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span></span><code><span><span><span>ProductOffer</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;→&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>DiscountAmount</span></span></span></code><span></span></p></td><td><p><span></span><code><span><span><span>formatDiscount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>App.tsx:271</span></span></span></code><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>结算</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span></span><code><span><span><span>OrderSummary</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;→&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>DiscountAmount</span></span></span></code><span></span></p></td><td><p><span></span><code><span><span><span>formatDiscount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>App.tsx:271</span></span></span></code><span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>两条组件路径指向同一个</span></span></span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><code><span><span><span>DiscountAmount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>，它渲染时调用的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>formatDiscount</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;没有处理缺失的折扣值。因此，这次需要修复共享的格式化函数，并检查商品报价和订单汇总两个区域。JS 堆栈给出了修改哪一行，React 组件堆栈给出了哪些业务组件使用了这段代码。</span></span></span></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"section-05-1-1-1-发布后-报错是否恢复\">05 1.1.1 发布后，报错是否恢复<br><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-05-1-1-1-发布后-报错是否恢复\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：05 1.1.1 发布后，报错是否恢复\">#</a></h2><h3 id=\"section-上线一段时间后-直接追问\"><span><span><span>▍</span></span><span><strong><span>上线一段时间后，直接追问</span></strong></span><span><strong><span><br></span></strong></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-上线一段时间后-直接追问\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：▍上线一段时间后，直接追问\">#</a></h3><p><span><span><span>修复版本&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>1.1.1</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;上线并积累一段时间的访问数据后，可以回到同一对话中问：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><blockquote><p><span>web-react-demo 的 1.1.1 已经上线一段时间了。最近 1 小时，Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'toFixed') 这个报错还出现吗？如果还有，是旧版本还是 1.1.1？商品详情页的加购和结算页的支付恢复了吗？</span></p></blockquote><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>这次查询聚焦&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>1.1.1</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;的访问量、原报错是否仍然出现，以及加购成功的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>cart_added</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>、模拟支付成功的&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>order_paid</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;事件。如果旧版本仍有报错，也能按版本区分，避免把它算到修复版本上。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>下面是本文演示数据中的版本对比结果：</span></span></span></p><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_78d15edee96740aebfecdf1f255f38b6.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span>图 5：演示样本中各版本的加购与模拟支付事件，</span></span></p><p><span><span>商品和结算分别统计。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>在本次已入库的折扣缺失样本中，</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>1.1.0</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;的 3 个商品会话和 2 个结算会话均发生异常；</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>1.1.1</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;对应的 3 个商品会话完成了加购，2 个结算会话完成了模拟支付，均未复现该异常。</span></span></span></p><h3 id=\"section-用-mission-持续观察后续发布\"><span><span><span>▍</span></span><span><strong><span>用 Mission 持续观察后续发布</span></strong></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-用-mission-持续观察后续发布\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：▍用 Mission 持续观察后续发布\">#</a></h3><p><span><span><span>如果希望每次发布后都自动检查，可以在 STAROps 中创建一个长期任务，选择「RUM 发布观察」模板：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><blockquote><p><span>为 web-react-demo 创建一个长期的发布观察任务，每小时检查一次。自动发现新版本，对比它与此前稳定版本的 JS 错误、页面和接口性能，持续观察 24 小时，并把报告保存在任务中。</span></p></blockquote><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本例已创建&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>web-react-demo 发布观察 Mission</span></span><sup><strong><span>[</span></strong></sup><sup><strong><span>5]</span></strong></sup></span><span><span><span>（免登查看），每小时第 5 分钟运行。后续发布新版本时，可以打开同一个任务查看执行记录和观察报告。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_7d9ef7bc94b1403b813d3e1b00604154.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span>图 6：web-react-demo 的发布观察计划，</span></span></p><p><span><span>每小时检查一次，自动识别版本并对比错误和性能。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>任务于 2026 年 9 月 15 日 12:05 自动触发，约 4 分 38 秒后完成并生成了</span></span></span><span><span><span>首次观察报告</span></span><sup><strong><span>[</span></strong></sup><sup><strong><span>6]</span></strong></sup></span><span><span><span>（免登查看）。这次回看过去 24 小时，共识别 3 个版本、70 个会话，查询范围比前面的案例截图更大。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>报告在&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>1.1.0</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;中查到 11 次&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>t</span></span><span><span>oFixed</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;错误，影响 10 个会话；</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>1.1.1</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;没有出现这条错误，但&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>/api/orders</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;和&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>/api/quote</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;的 p90 延迟约为 1.4 秒。任务把这些接口列了出来，便于继续排查。</span></span></span></p><p></p><figure><img src=\"https://ucc.alicdn.com/pic/developer-ecology/pawmkwdq37c7s_3f0e167ced114200b058e3505e6c8aea.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></figure><p></p><p><span><span>图 7：首次自动执行报告中的接口延迟对比，</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.1.1 的订单与报价接口延迟偏高。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本次&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>1.1.1</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;只有 19 个会话，后续还需积累样本、继续观察。每轮执行记录和报告都会保存在同一个 Mission 中。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><h2 id=\"section-结语\">结语<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-结语\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：结语\">#</a></h2><p><span><span><span>这次排查中，JS 堆栈把错误定位到&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>formatDiscount</span></span></span><span><span><span>，React 组件堆栈进一步指出它分别影响&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>ProductOffer</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>&nbsp;和&nbsp;</span></span></span><code><span><span><span>OrderSummary</span></span></span></code><span><span><span>。RUM SDK 的 React 支持，让被错误边界捕获的渲染异常也能带着组件上下文进入分析。修复后，再查看加购、支付是否恢复，并用 Mission 持续观察后续版本的错误和性能。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>可以打开&nbsp;</span></span></span><span><span><span>STAROps 免登演示</span></span><sup><strong><span>[</span></strong></sup><sup><strong><span>7]</span></strong></sup></span><span><span><span>，从文首的问题开始体验，再在同一对话里继续追问。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>相关链接：</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>[1]&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>点击即分析：查看最近 7 天的前端报错</span></span></span><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><em><a href=\"https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.5.48436ffaY9QWtL&amp;dest=%252Fchat%253FassistantId%253Dstarops-demo%2526fixedAssistantId%253Dstarops-demo%2526region%253Dcn-hongkong%2526initWorkspace%253Ddefault-cms-1819385687343877-cn-hongkong%2526hideWorkspaceSwitch%253Dtrue%2526showStarOpsReplayProgress%253Dtrue%2526staropsClusterRegion%253Dcn-beijing%2526initialQuestion%253D%2525E5%25259C%2525A8%252Bworkspace%252Bdefault-cms-1819385687343877-cn-hongkong%252B%2525E4%2525B8%2525AD%2525EF%2525BC%25258Cweb-react-demo%252B%2525E6%25259C%252580%2525E8%2525BF%252591%252B7%252B%2525E5%2525A4%2525A9%2525E6%25259C%252589%2525E5%252593%2525AA%2525E4%2525BA%25259B%2525E5%252589%25258D%2525E7%2525AB%2525AF%2525E6%25258A%2525A5%2525E9%252594%252599%2525EF%2525BC%25259F%2525E5%2525BD%2525B1%2525E5%252593%25258D%2525E4%2525BA%252586%2525E5%252593%2525AA%2525E4%2525BA%25259B%2525E9%2525A1%2525B5%2525E9%25259D%2525A2%2525EF%2525BC%25258C%2525E6%252598%2525AF%2525E4%2525BB%252580%2525E4%2525B9%252588%2525E5%25258E%25259F%2525E5%25259B%2525A0%2525EF%2525BC%25259F%2526initialQuestionMode%253Dsend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html?dest=%2Fchat%3FassistantId%3Dstarops-demo%26fixedAssistantId%3Dstarops-demo%26region%3Dcn-hongkong%26initWorkspace%3Ddefault-cms-1819385687343877-cn-hongkong%26hideWorkspaceSwitch%3Dtrue%26showStarOpsReplayProgress%3Dtrue%26staropsClusterRegion%3Dcn-beijing%26initialQuestion%3D%25E5%259C%25A8%2Bworkspace%2Bdefault-cms-1819385687343877-cn-hongkong%2B%25E4%25B8%25AD%25EF%25BC%258Cweb-react-demo%2B%25E6%259C%2580%25E8%25BF%2591%2B7%2B%25E5%25A4%25A9%25E6%259C%2589%25E5%2593%25AA%25E4%25BA%259B%25E5%2589%258D%25E7%25AB%25AF%25E6%258A%25A5%25E9%2594%2599%25EF%25BC%259F%25E5%25BD%25B1%25E5%2593%258D%25E4%25BA%2586%25E5%2593%25AA%25E4%25BA%259B%25E9%25A1%25B5%25E9%259D%25A2%25EF%25BC%258C%25E6%2598%25AF%25E4%25BB%2580%25E4%25B9%2588%25E5%258E%259F%25E5%259B%25A0%25EF%25BC%259F%26initialQuestionMode%3Dsend</a></em><span><br></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>[2]&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>自由体验 STAROps Playground</span></span></span><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><em><a href=\"https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.6.48436ffaY9QWtL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html</a></em><span><br></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>[3]&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>Web/H5 接入文档</span></span></span><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><em><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/arms/user-experience-monitoring/access-web-h5-applications?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.7.48436ffaY9QWtL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://help.aliyun.com/zh/arms/user-experience-monitoring/access-web-h5-applications</a></em><span><br></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>[4]&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>CMS2 CLI 符号表上传文档</span></span></span><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><em><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/arms/user-experience-monitoring/use-cases/upload-rum-symbol-table-files-by-using-cms2-cli?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.8.48436ffaY9QWtL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://help.aliyun.com/zh/arms/user-experience-monitoring/use-cases/upload-rum-symbol-table-files-by-using-cms2-cli</a></em><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>[5]&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>web-react-demo 发布观察 Mission</span></span></span><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><em><a href=\"https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.9.48436ffaY9QWtL&amp;dest=%252Fmission%252Fmission-61uvl2dpup5h1giz90%252Fstarops-demo%252Fplan%253FassistantId%253Dstarops-demo%2526fixedAssistantId%253Dstarops-demo%2526region%253Dcn-hongkong%2526initWorkspace%253Ddefault-cms-1819385687343877-cn-hongkong%2526hideWorkspaceSwitch%253Dtrue%2526showStarOpsReplayProgress%253Dtrue%2526staropsClusterRegion%253Dcn-beijing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html?dest=%2Fmission%2Fmission-61uvl2dpup5h1giz90%2Fstarops-demo%2Fplan%3FassistantId%3Dstarops-demo%26fixedAssistantId%3Dstarops-demo%26region%3Dcn-hongkong%26initWorkspace%3Ddefault-cms-1819385687343877-cn-hongkong%26hideWorkspaceSwitch%3Dtrue%26showStarOpsReplayProgress%3Dtrue%26staropsClusterRegion%3Dcn-beijing</a></em><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>[6]&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>首次观察报告</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><em><a href=\"https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.10.48436ffaY9QWtL&amp;dest=%252Fmission%252Fmission-61uvl2dpup5h1giz90%252Fstarops-demo%252Freport%253FassistantId%253Dstarops-demo%2526fixedAssistantId%253Dstarops-demo%2526region%253Dcn-hongkong%2526initWorkspace%253Ddefault-cms-1819385687343877-cn-hongkong%2526hideWorkspaceSwitch%253Dtrue%2526showStarOpsReplayProgress%253Dtrue%2526staropsClusterRegion%253Dcn-beijing%2526artifact%253D2026-09%25252F09-15%25252Frum-release-observation-12-05.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html?dest=%2Fmission%2Fmission-61uvl2dpup5h1giz90%2Fstarops-demo%2Freport%3FassistantId%3Dstarops-demo%26fixedAssistantId%3Dstarops-demo%26region%3Dcn-hongkong%26initWorkspace%3Ddefault-cms-1819385687343877-cn-hongkong%26hideWorkspaceSwitch%3Dtrue%26showStarOpsReplayProgress%3Dtrue%26staropsClusterRegion%3Dcn-beijing%26artifact%3D2026-09%252F09-15%252Frum-release-observation-12-05.md</a></em><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>[7]&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>STAROps 免登演示</span></span></span></p><p><span><em><a href=\"https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html?spm=a2c6h.13046898.publish-article.11.48436ffaY9QWtL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sls.aliyun.com/doc/playground/staropsdemo.html</a></em></span></p>",
